# Agon Wastes 0d_sand_hall L0: CPillBug e00100053 (planar 2) and e0010004a/40/26/37 (planar 1),
# looping 9-13 waypoint paths, no IS00. The planar-2 bug is bombed into Fall/Injured/Wander (the
# Wander planar-2 arm), the others patrol, and a planar-1 bug is bombed after a touch.
@f200 god 1; give morphBall 1; give morphBallBombs 1; give missile 50
@f220 objs PillBug; objs CPlayer
@f300 place e00100053 player 2
@f360 obj e00100053
@f400 press x 20
@f460 press a 4
@f462 place e00100053 player 0
@f520 obj e00100053
@f600 obj e00100053
@f700 obj e00100053
@f800 obj e00100053
@f1000 obj e00100053
@f1200 obj e00100053
@f1300 place e0010004a player 0
@f1310 press a 4
@f1312 place e0010004a player 0
@f1400 obj e0010004a
@f1600 obj e0010004a
@f1800 obj e0010004a; obj e00100053
@f2000 objs PillBug
